{"id":158,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Despite the smallness of its body, Totodile’s jaws are very powerful. While the Pokémon may think it is just playfully nipping, its bite has enough power to cause serious injury."},{"games":["Y","HeartGold"],"text":"Its powerful, well-developed jaws are capable of crushing anything. Even its Trainer must be careful."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It is small but rough and tough. It won’t hesitate to take a bite out of anything that moves."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It has the habit of biting anything with its developed jaws. Even its Trainer needs to be careful."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"Its well-developed jaws are powerful and capable of crushing anything. Even its TRAINER must be careful."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Despite its small body, TOTODILE’s jaws are very powerful. While it may think it is just playfully nipping, its bite has enough strength to cause serious injury."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"This rough critter chomps at any moving object it sees. Turning your back on it is not recommended."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Torrent","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up Water-type moves when the Pokémon's HP is low."},{"name":"Sheer Force","hidden":true,"description":"Removes any additional effects from the Pokémon's moves, but increases the moves' power."}],"eggGroups":["Monster","Water 1"],"genderRate":1,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Blue","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":158,"name":"Totodile","condition":null,"children":[{"id":159,"name":"Croconaw","condition":"Lv. 18","children":[{"id":160,"name":"Feraligatr","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,10],[1,43],[6,55],[9,44],[13,184],[19,423],[22,175],[27,242],[30,163],[33,103],[37,37],[41,401],[45,276],[